### Login para obter token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "qwe",
    "password": "qwe"
}

###
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### GetAllPasto
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPasto HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetPastoByID
GET http://localhost:40000/getPastoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### InsertPasto
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPasto HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Pasto Leste",
    "areatotal": 95.40,
    "removido": false
}

### UpdatePasto
PUT http://localhost:40000/updatePasto/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Pasto Norte Atualizado",
    "areatotal": 130.00,
    "removido": false
}

### DeletePasto
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deletePasto/3 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}